# Build context for deploy/Dockerfile. BuildKit prefers this over the repo
# root's .dockerignore, which excludes **/.next and **/node_modules — correct
# for upstream Supabase, fatal for an image made entirely of the traced server.
#
# Docker does not descend into an excluded directory, so `*` followed by
# `!apps/studio/.next/standalone` silently matches nothing: `apps` is already
# excluded and never walked. Re-including a deep path needs an alternating
# exclude/include at every level, which is why CI stages the tree to deploy/app
# and this only has to reach two levels down.
*
!deploy
deploy/*
!deploy/app
!deploy/start.sh
